WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,000
Help, kindhearted person

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,360
Please take me to the hospital

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:10,730
The child in my house is dying. Stop the car.

4
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,290
Didn't you see he was bleeding?

5
00:00:12,290 --> 00:00:13,210
It's going to cost someone's life

6
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:16,270
Our Lady of Mohs died first

7
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:21,260
I'm not a good person. What are you going to do?

8
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,500
That's a pregnant woman with dystocia. Do you believe it or not? Do you have any humanity?

9
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,620
I'll give you a break right away

10
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:30,540
There is still a baby in my belly

11
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:31,980
Forget it if you don’t save me

12
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,540
Why did you hit him again?

13
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,380
What I hate the most is you

14
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:37,100
Cold-blooded survivor
